    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, but the food thing is gonna take way too long and i'm feeling really shaky right now. like, i feel like i'm actually crashing. i have these high strength tabs specifically for electrolyte replacement, and the bottle says they're for intense training. wouldn't it be more effective to just get the concentration in my system quickly so the cramps stop? i just want to feel normal again.",
